   "caption": {
    "en": "Tonight is Bhoot Chaturdashi in Kolkata, and tomorrow is Kali Puja 🪔\n\nThis evening many Bengali homes light choddo prodip, fourteen small clay lamps at doorways, windows and dark corners, to keep harm away and light the way for the ancestors. And for dinner, choddo shaak: fourteen kinds of leafy greens cooked together.\n\nKali Puja is tomorrow, Sunday 8 November, usually through the night. Our guide is on pujoparikramaguide.in.\n\nDid your family make choddo shaak this year? Tell us in the comments 👇",
